# Product Requirements Document (PRD): Kidscover — Feature & User Story Breakdown

**Author:** Rajasekharan Gopakumar
**Document Status:** Draft (MVP Phase)

---

## Feature 1: User Authentication & Profile Management

**Description:** Enabling secure access and personalization for parents and school administrators.

### Frontend User Stories
- **US1.1 (Parent/Admin):** As a user, I want to sign up and log in using my phone number (OTP), Google, Microsoft, or Email account so that I can securely access the app without remembering a new password.
- **US1.2 (Parent/Admin):** As a user, I want to upload a profile picture or select a stock cartoon avatar so that I can personalize my account.
- **US1.3 (Parent):** As a user, I want to manage my app settings (Dark Mode, Push Notifications, Biometric Login, Language) so that the app matches my device preferences.

### Backend User Stories
- **US1.4 (Backend):** As a system, I need to integrate with OAuth providers (Google, Microsoft) and an SMS gateway (for OTP) to authenticate users securely and generate session tokens.
- **US1.5 (Backend):** As a system, I need to securely store user profile data (Name, Gender, Email, Phone, Encrypted Address Book) in the database and expose REST/GraphQL endpoints for the frontend to perform CRUD operations.

