## Feature 3: School Marketplace & Detail Pages

**Description:** Comprehensive data presentation for individual schools and comparison tools.

### Frontend User Stories
- **US3.1 (Parent):** As a parent, I want to view a detailed school profile showing enrollment numbers, board results, university placements, facilities, and aggregated Google ratings so that I can evaluate the school's quality.
- **US3.2 (Parent):** As a parent, I want to see a full breakdown of the fees that make up the Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) so I am not surprised by hidden charges.
- **US3.3 (Parent):** As a parent, I want to select up to 4 schools and view them in a side-by-side comparison matrix covering all attributes.

### Backend User Stories
- **US3.4 (Backend):** As a system, I need an endpoint that delivers full school profile data, structured facility tags, and aggregated rating scores to the client.
- **US3.5 (Backend):** As a system, I need a scheduled background job to pull and update aggregated public review scores (e.g., Google Places API) for listed schools.

---

## Feature 4: Admissions & Enquiry Gateway

**Description:** The hybrid application system connecting parents to schools.

### Frontend User Stories
- **US4.1 (Parent):** As a parent viewing a "Partner School," I want to fill out a standard Kidscover admission form (Parent details, Ward details, Address) directly in the app.
- **US4.2 (Parent):** As a parent viewing a "Non-Partner School," I want a button that redirects me to their official admission portal.
- **US4.3 (School Admin):** As a school admissions user, I want a dashboard to view incoming applications submitted via the Kidscover standard form.

### Backend User Stories
- **US4.4 (Backend):** As a system, I need to process submitted Kidscover standard forms and trigger a webhook/API call to securely transmit the payload to the specific Partner School's CRM system.
- **US4.5 (Backend):** As a system, I need to log the outbound clicks to Non-Partner schools for internal analytics and lead-tracking purposes.

---

## Feature 5: Ticketing & Notifications

**Description:** Secure, two-way communication channel.

### Frontend User Stories
- **US5.1 (Parent):** As a parent, I want to open a chat/ticket with a partner school's admission team to ask questions without sharing my personal phone number.
- **US5.2 (School Admin):** As a school admissions user, I want to reply to parent tickets within a dedicated portal interface.
- **US5.3 (Parent):** As a parent, I want to receive push notifications when a school replies to my ticket or when there is an update on my admission application.

### Backend User Stories
- **US5.4 (Backend):** As a system, I need a secure messaging schema to store chat tickets, associating them with a masked parent ID and the specific school ID.
- **US5.5 (Backend):** As a system, I need to integrate with a Push Notification service (e.g., Firebase Cloud Messaging / APNs) to trigger alerts based on database status changes in the ticketing or admissions table.
